<title>USA: SIPEX to file for three mln share offer.</title>
<headline>SIPEX to file for three mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SIPEX Corp said on Monday that it intended to file a registration statement in the next seven days with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a three million common stock offering.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to offer about one million shares and certain shareholders would offer the other two million shares. Proceeds from the sale would be used for working capital and general corporate purposes, SIPEX said.</p>
<p>SIPEX would not receive any proceeds from the shareholders' anticipated sale.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
